  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women; WPS at the Core of the Crisis Response Project in Myanmar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is directly aligned with the UN Women Myanmar Interim Strategic Note 2021 &#x2013; 2023.  Its goal is to ensure that &#x2018;Women and girls affected by crisis lead, participate in and benefit from relief, response, peace and development efforts&#x2019; in Myanmar, thereby contributing to a more peaceful and gender equal society.    The primary beneficiaries are women and girls in Myanmar in conflict-affected states and regions. Secondary     beneficiaries are W-CSO participating in, advocating for, and ensuring accountability measures on WPS commitments or women CSO engaged in inclusive and gender responsive emergency and/or nexus planning, and programming in conflict affected regions/states</narrative>
  </description>
